<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK GROUP TO ISSUE FIM 150 MLN BOND.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK GROUP TO ISSUE FIM 150 MLN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank OKOBANK said in a statement on Tuesday it would issue together with co-operative banks a 150 million markka three-year variable rate bond with a 3.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>&quot;The subscription period of the bond runs from December 30, 1996 to February 28, 1997,&quot; OKOBANK said.</p>
<p>A bourse listing will be sought for the bond after the subscription period, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
